---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service: Private PDF Word Counter"
  description="Terms and conditions for utilizing the PDF Word Counter browser utility."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 space-y-10">
    <div class="space-y-2 border-b border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 pb-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-800 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-700">
        Legal Agreement
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">
        Effective Date: September 15, 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-neutral dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By visiting, accessing, or using <strong>PDF Word Counter</strong> (the "Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you disagree with any portion of these terms, your sole remedy is to discontinue use of the Service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">2. Service Scope & In-Browser Execution</h2>
        <p>
          PDF Word Counter provides a free web-based utility that inspects PDF files locally in your device's browser memory to calculate word counts, character lengths, page totals, and estimated reading speeds. We do not host, store, or transmit your files over our servers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">3. Intellectual Property Rights & Document Ownership</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>You retain 100% of all intellectual property rights, copyright, and ownership of any documents you inspect using the Service</strong>. Because our tool does not upload files, we never gain access to, license over, or rights to your documents.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">4. Calculation Accuracy & Disclaimers</h2>
        <p>
          While our text extraction algorithms are engineered for rigorous mathematical accuracy based on the official PDF specification, count variations may occur across complex typography, ligature glyphs, mathematical formulas, or OCR artifacts. The Service is provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis without warranties of any kind.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          In no event shall PDF Word Counter, its operators, or contributors be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages (including without limitation loss of profits, data, or contractual billing disputes) arising out of or in connection with the use of the Service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">6. Acceptable Use Policy</h2>
        <p>
          You agree not to attempt to reverse engineer, disrupt, overload, or launch automated scraping/denial-of-service attacks against our web hosting infrastructure.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">7. Inquiries</h2>
        <p>
          For legal inquiries or questions concerning these Terms of Service, please contact: <a href="mailto:support@pdfwordcounter.org" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 underline">support@pdfwordcounter.org</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
